flowchart LR
  subgraph Frontend[Frontend (Angular / Vite)]
    FW[User Browser / UI]
    FW -->|REST: GET /games, GET /analysis, POST /upload| API[API Server (Express)]
    FW -->|Auth requests| AUTH[Auth (Supabase)]
    subgraph UIComponents[UI Components]
      CB[Chess Board Component]
      ML[Move List Component]
      WP[Win Probability Component]
    end
    FW --> UIComponents
  end

  subgraph Backend[Backend Services]
    API -->|routes/controllers| CONTROLLERS[Controllers & Routes]
    CONTROLLERS -->|validate PGN| PGNPARSER[PGN Parser]
    CONTROLLERS -->|enqueue analysis| QUEUE[Analysis Queue / Job Runner]
    CONTROLLERS -->|query/write| DB_LAYER[Database Layer]
    CONTROLLERS -->|cache responses (5m)| CACHE[In-memory Cache]

    QUEUE --> ANALYZER[Analyzer Service]
    ANALYZER -->|spawn/communicate| STOCKFISH[Stockfish Engine]
    ANALYZER -->|compute metrics| METRICS[Accuracy/Performance Calculators]
    METRICS --> DB_LAYER
    PGNPARSER --> FILES[File Storage (Game-PGNs / uploads)]
    CONTROLLERS --> FILES
    CONTROLLERS -->|auth check| AUTH
  end

  subgraph DataStores[Data & External Services]
    DB[SQLite DB (chess_analysis.db)]
    FILES
    AUTH
  end

  DB_LAYER --> DB
  FILES -->|store PGN files| GamePGN[Game-PGNs folder]
  AUTH -->|OAuth/JWT| API

  API -->|200 OK / JSON| FW
  CACHE -->|hits/miss| CONTROLLERS
  DB -->|read/write analysis| CONTROLLERS
